---
import Layout from '../layouts/Layout.astro';
import Header from '../components/Header.astro';
import Footer from '../components/Footer.astro';
---

<Layout
  title="Privacy Policy & Terms | avilano.dev"
  description="Privacy policy, data handling, and terms of use for avilano.dev, including QA & CI Diagnostic submissions, in-house Vercel Serverless Function and Linear processing, digital product licensing, and data deletion requests."
>
  <Header />
  <main id="main-content" class="flex-grow py-16 md:py-24">
    <article class="max-w-3xl mx-auto px-4 sm:px-6">
      <div class="mb-10 pb-8 border-b border-zinc-200">
        <span class="inline-block font-mono text-xs text-sky-700 font-semibold uppercase tracking-wider mb-3">
          Legal &amp; Data Governance
        </span>
        <h1 class="text-3xl sm:text-4xl font-extrabold text-zinc-950 tracking-tight">
          Privacy Policy &amp; Terms of Use
        </h1>
        <p class="mt-3 text-sm text-zinc-600 font-mono">
          Last updated: November 2026 · Version 1.0
        </p>
      </div>

      <div class="space-y-6 text-zinc-700 text-sm sm:text-base leading-relaxed">
        <section class="p-6 rounded-xl border border-zinc-200 bg-white">
          <h2 class="text-lg sm:text-xl font-bold text-zinc-950 mb-3">
            1. Data Collected via the QA &amp; CI Diagnostic
          </h2>
          <p class="mb-3">
            When you complete the interactive QA &amp; CI Pipeline Readiness Diagnostic on <span class="font-mono text-zinc-950">avilano.dev</span>, we collect only the information you explicitly submit:
          </p>
          <ul class="list-disc pl-5 space-y-1.5 text-zinc-700">
            <li><strong class="text-zinc-950">Contact details:</strong> Name, Company, and Work Email.</li>
            <li><strong class="text-zinc-950">Diagnostic responses:</strong> Your answers regarding CI runtime and flake frequency, pre-merge release gating, WCAG 2.1 AA / AI safety gates, primary friction point, engineering team scale, computed readiness score, and any optional stack notes you provide.</li>
          </ul>
          <p class="mt-3 text-zinc-600 text-sm">
            This information is used solely to deliver your diagnostic scorecard and respond if you choose to book an architecture review. We never sell, rent, or trade your data to third-party brokers.
          </p>
        </section>

        <section class="p-6 rounded-xl border border-zinc-200 bg-white">
          <h2 class="text-lg sm:text-xl font-bold text-zinc-950 mb-3">
            2. In-House Form Processing (Vercel &amp; Linear)
          </h2>
          <p>
            Diagnostic form submissions are handled directly by our in-house <strong class="text-zinc-950">Vercel Serverless Functions</strong> over encrypted HTTPS connections and logged into our private <strong class="text-zinc-950">Linear</strong> workspace for follow-up. No third-party form embeds or external form-tracking scripts are loaded on this site. If you schedule a call via Cal.com, your booking details are handled directly by Cal.com under its privacy policy.
          </p>
        </section>

        <section class="p-6 rounded-xl border border-zinc-200 bg-white">
          <h2 class="text-lg sm:text-xl font-bold text-zinc-950 mb-3">
            3. Zero Third-Party Advertising Cookies
          </h2>
          <p>
            <span class="font-mono text-zinc-950">avilano.dev</span> uses zero third-party advertising cookies, retargeting pixels, or cross-site ad trackers. Aggregate page-view metrics are collected using privacy-first, cookieless analytics, and third-party embeds (such as the scheduling widget) are lazy-loaded only when scrolled into view or explicitly activated.
          </p>
        </section>

        <section class="p-6 rounded-xl border border-zinc-200 bg-white">
          <h2 class="text-lg sm:text-xl font-bold text-zinc-950 mb-3">
            4. Data Access &amp; Deletion Requests
          </h2>
          <p>
            You may request a copy, correction, or complete deletion of any information you have submitted at any time. Send an email from your work address to{' '}
            <a
              href="mailto:contact@avilano.dev?subject=Data%20Deletion%20Request"
              class="text-sky-700 underline underline-offset-4 hover:text-zinc-950 focus-visible:outline-none focus-visible:ring-2 focus-visible:ring-brand-600 rounded font-medium"
            >
              contact@avilano.dev
            </a>{' '}
            with the subject line <span class="font-mono text-zinc-950">Data Deletion Request</span>, and your records will be permanently removed from Linear and our inbox within 5 business days.
          </p>
        </section>

        <!-- Terms of Use & Digital Product License (R10) -->
        <section id="terms" class="p-6 rounded-xl border border-zinc-200 bg-white scroll-mt-24">
          <h2 class="text-lg sm:text-xl font-bold text-zinc-950 mb-3">
            5. Terms of Use &amp; Digital Product License
          </h2>
          <div class="space-y-3">
            <p>
              <strong class="text-zinc-950">Commercial Team License:</strong> Purchasing any Digital Kit or the All-Access Bundle via <strong class="text-zinc-950">Polar.sh</strong> grants your organization a perpetual, non-exclusive, worldwide commercial license to use, modify, and integrate the templates, Cursor rules, checklists, and CI/CD configurations across your internal repositories and client delivery pipelines.
            </p>
            <p>
              <strong class="text-zinc-950">Restrictions:</strong> You may not resell, redistribute, or publish the raw kits as standalone competing digital products.
            </p>
            <p>
              <strong class="text-zinc-950">Delivery &amp; Refunds:</strong> Digital kits are delivered immediately upon payment confirmation through Polar.sh. Because digital assets are accessible immediately, sales are final once downloaded. If you experience a billing error, duplicate charge, or corrupted archive, email <a href="mailto:contact@avilano.dev" class="text-sky-700 underline underline-offset-4 hover:text-zinc-950 font-medium">contact@avilano.dev</a> within 14 days for prompt resolution.
            </p>
            <p class="text-xs sm:text-sm text-zinc-600">
              All technical articles and sample code on <span class="font-mono text-zinc-950">avilano.dev</span> are provided for informational and engineering reference purposes and do not constitute formal legal counsel.
            </p>
          </div>
        </section>

        <!-- Version History (R10) -->
        <section aria-labelledby="version-history-heading" class="p-6 rounded-xl border border-zinc-200 bg-zinc-50">
          <h2 id="version-history-heading" class="text-sm font-mono font-bold uppercase tracking-wider text-zinc-950 mb-3">
            Version History
          </h2>
          <ul class="space-y-2 text-xs font-mono text-zinc-600">
            <li class="flex flex-col sm:flex-row sm:items-center gap-1 sm:gap-3">
              <span class="px-2 py-0.5 rounded bg-zinc-950 text-white font-semibold w-fit">v1.0 - Nov 2026</span>
              <span>Initial policy covering QA &amp; CI Diagnostic submissions, Polar.sh Digital Kits, Commercial Team License, and Terms of Use.</span>
            </li>
          </ul>
        </section>
      </div>

      <div class="mt-10">
        <a
          href="/"
          class="inline-flex items-center gap-2 text-sm font-mono font-semibold text-sky-700 hover:text-zinc-950 transition-colors focus-visible:outline-none focus-visible:ring-2 focus-visible:ring-brand-600 rounded"
        >
          &larr; Back to Home
        </a>
      </div>
    </article>
  </main>
  <Footer />
</Layout>
